{
  "uid": "claude-code",
  "title": "Claude Code",
  "tags": [
    "claude-code",
    "otel"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. $ per day by model",
      "description": "claude_code.cost.usage: client-side estimate at list price, not a bill. One bar per UTC day (21:00-21:00 at UTC-3): Grafana aligns a 1d step to midnight UTC, so the bar at day D uses offset -1d to cover D 00:00 to D+1 00:00; today's bar grows during the day.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(claude_code_cost_usage_USD_total[1d] anchored offset -1d))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "2a. $ by active skill at request time (selected range)",
      "description": "skill.name on claude_code.cost.usage is the ACTIVE skill when the request was made, not the cost of running the skill. In the main loop it is the last skill the model invoked with the Skill tool, and it stays until another skill is invoked (Claude Code 2.1.287: options.activeSkill is restored only for fork-mode skills or a failed call). So a skill invoked early in a session collects the rest of that session. Requests before any skill have no skill.name and are left out. Real names need OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{skill_name}}",
          "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (skill_name) (increase(claude_code_cost_usage_USD_total{skill_name!=\"\"}[$__range] anchored)))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "2b. $ by subagent (selected range)",
      "description": "agent.name on claude_code.cost.usage: requests made inside a subagent (built-in agents by name, custom ones by name with OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1). Main-loop requests have no agent.name and are left out.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{agent_name}}",
          "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (agent_name) (increase(claude_code_cost_usage_USD_total{agent_name!=\"\"}[$__range] anchored)))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3. Tokens per hour by type",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (type) (increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total[1h] anchored))",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "3. Cache hit (selected range)",
      "description": "cacheRead / (input + cacheRead + cacheCreation).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.85
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total{type=\"cacheRead\"}[$__range] anchored)) / sum(increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total{type=~\"input|cacheRead|cacheCreation\"}[$__range] anchored))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4. Edit acceptance per day",
      "description": "claude_code.code_edit_tool.decision counts permission decisions (accept/reject) for Edit, Write and NotebookEdit - every time a permission check decides on an edit, not every edit made. The source label says who decided: user_temporary / user_permanent (you, in the prompt), user_reject / user_abort (you refused), config (an allow or deny rule), classifier (auto mode), hook. The line is the accepted share of all decisions; bars split the decisions by source. One point per UTC day, offset -1d as in panel 1.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "A"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.drawStyle",
                "value": "line"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.pointSize",
                "value": 8
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.showPoints",
                "value": "always"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "accepted share",
          "expr": "sum(increase(claude_code_code_edit_tool_decision_total{decision=\"accept\"}[1d] anchored offset -1d)) / sum(increase(claude_code_code_edit_tool_decision_total[1d] anchored offset -1d))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "{{decision}} by {{source}}",
          "expr": "sum by (decision, source) (increase(claude_code_code_edit_tool_decision_total[1d] anchored offset -1d))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5. Gate blocks per hour",
      "description": "Hooks (guard_bash, dep_gate): tool_decision events with source=hook that were not accepted, and blocking hook_execution_complete outcomes. Deny rules from user settings are reported as user_reject, the same as a manual refusal, so they are not counted. Hourly bars: Grafana aligns a 1d step to midnight UTC and LogQL has no negative offset, so per-day bars would stay empty until the day ends; the bar at hour H covers H-1h to H.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "hook denied {{tool_name}}",
          "expr": "sum by (tool_name) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"tool_decision\" | source=\"hook\" | decision!=\"accept\" [1h]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "blocking {{hook_event}}",
          "expr": "sum by (hook_event) (sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"hook_execution_complete\" | num_blocking!=\"0\" | unwrap num_blocking [1h]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "6. PR cycle time (deferred)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Deferred until a repository with a PR flow. Plan: a gh-based script, AI PRs marked with the label `ai`."
      }
    }
  ],
  "description": "increase(... anchored): counters are per session (session.id kept) and start at zero (created-timestamp-zero-ingestion); anchored ranges do not extrapolate, which inflated short sessions by ~50% in the first test."
}
